VectorCraft v0.21.0-android.2
Owner-tested regression fix: avoid black startup display with a temporary branded cover.
Expose Import Font, Select Shared Font Folder, Refresh Shared Fonts, Check for Updates, and Startup Updates under top-left Vc menu.
